SUMMARY:💖 Return to Love Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 💖 Return to Love W
 orkshop\n\n### With John Stringer\n\n📅 **Sunday\, October 4th**\n⏰ **
 12:45 – 1:45 PM**\n📍 **Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**\n💗 
 **Love Offering — No One Turned Away**\n\nJoin us for a **one-of-a-kind 
 interactive healing experience** with award-winning recording artist\, Top
  10 Billboard-charting singer-songwriter\, and international bestselling a
 uthor **John Stringer**.\n\nJohn will first join us for our **11 AM Sunday
  Celebration**\, sharing the morning message and his music. Following our 
 delicious **covered dish luncheon**\, John invites us to go deeper with an
  engaging and experiential **Return to Love Workshop**.\n\n🌟 **A Journe
 y of Remembering**\nThis interactive experience invites us to explore the 
 tools and abilities already within us as we:\n✨ Remember who we truly ar
 e\n🌿 Shift what is ready to be shifted\n🕊️ Release what is no long
 er serving us\n💫 Connect with our inner wisdom\n🎶 Explore healing th
 rough music and toning\n❤️ Move beyond the need to continually “fix
 ” or change ourselves\n🌈 Remember that **we are the ones we’ve been
  waiting for**\n\nThis isn't simply a workshop to listen to—it is an opp
 ortunity to **participate\, experience\, and contribute**. Through guided 
 experiences\, music\, alignment\, toning\, and your own inner wisdom\, Joh
 n will create space for us to collectively reconnect with the truth and wh
 oleness within.\n\n🎵 **Music • Alignment • Inner Wisdom • Toning 
 • Connection • Healing**\n\nCome experience an afternoon of music\, co
 nnection\, and transformation as we **Return to Love**—together.\n\n💗
  **Love Offering**\n\nEveryone is welcome. No one turned away.\n\n#ReturnT
 oLove #JohnStringer #HealingJourney #InnerWisdom #Consciousness #Spiritual
 Growth #MusicAndHealing #Toning #CenterForSpiritualLiving #CSLAsheville #C
 ommunityCommonsAsheville #AshevilleNC
