SUMMARY:🥁 Friday Spirit Express: Drum Circle
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🥁 Friday Spirit Ex
 press: Drum Circle\n\n**Friday\, October 9th at 7:00 PM**\n💚 **Love Off
 ering**\nCome gather for an evening of **music\, community\, rhythm\, and 
 energy!** 🥁✨\n\nBring your:\n🎶 **Drums**\n🪈 **Flutes**\n🔥 **
 Passion**\n😄 **Playfulness**\n💫 **Creative Spirit**\n\nTogether\, we
 'll create **spontaneous\, improvised music** and explore the joy of makin
 g something beautiful in the moment.\n\n💃 **Dancers are welcome!** Come
  move\, groove\, listen\, play\, or simply soak up the energy of the circl
 e.\n\nNo need to be a seasoned musician — just bring your instrument\, y
 our curiosity\, and your willingness to play!\n\n🌟 **Let's make some mu
 sic\, share some energy\, and celebrate community!**\n\n📅 **Friday\, Oc
 tober 9th**\n⏰ **7:00 PM**\n💚 **Love Offering**\n\n#FriSpiritExpress 
 #DrumCircle #CommunityMusic #Drumming #ImprovisedMusic #LiveMusic #DanceAn
 dDrum #CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville #AshevilleNC
