SUMMARY:🐾 PET BLESSING 🐾
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n🐾 **PET BLESSING** 
 🐾\n\n### In Honor of St. Francis of Assisi\n\n💛 **Come One & All!** 
 💛\nJoin Rev. Dr. Suzi Schadle and the Prayer Practitioners of Center fo
 r Spiritual Living Asheville for a special **Pet Blessing** in honor of **
 St. Francis of Assisi**\, the patron saint of animals and nature.\n\n🐶
 🐱 **Bring your beloved pets** to receive a blessing!\n🐾 Blessings wi
 ll also be offered for **pets awaiting adoption**.\n🙏 We will offer an 
 **overall blessing for the Asheville Humane Society**\, its staff\, volunt
 eers\, and the animals in their care.\n\n📅 **Saturday\, October 10th**\
 n⏰ **10:00 AM – 2:00 PM**\n📍 **Asheville Humane Society**\n14 Forev
 er Friend Lane\nAsheville\, NC 28806\n\n💝 **Love Offering and/or Pet Fo
 od Donation**\nThis special community gathering is an opportunity to celeb
 rate the unconditional love\, companionship\, and joy that animals bring i
 nto our lives—and to extend our love and blessings to those still waitin
 g for their forever homes.\n\n🐾 Bring your furry\, feathered\, or other
 wise beloved companions!\n❤️ Come share the love.\n🙏 Come receive a
  blessing.\n🏡 Come support the animals and people of Asheville Humane S
 ociety.\n\n**Please note: This event is being held at the Asheville Humane
  Society\, not at Center for Spiritual Living Asheville.**\n\n#PetBlessing
  #StFrancisOfAssisi #AshevilleHumaneSociety #AshevilleNC #BlessingOfTheAni
 mals #LoveOffering #PetFoodDonation #AnimalBlessing #Community #CenterForS
 piritualLivingAsheville
